From 4d281b4b52c8771a79028cd68c41f4098ee3bacb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PePe Amengual <2208324+jamengual@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:51:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] kubeadm: adapt a Linux control plane's kubelet config paths
 on FreeBSD join

kubeadm join downloads the cluster's KubeletConfiguration. When a Linux control
plane generated it, clientCAFile and staticPodPath point under /etc/kubernetes,
which on FreeBSD is /usr/local/etc/kubernetes (constants.KubernetesDir), and
resolvConf is systemd-resolved's file; the kubelet then fails to start with
"open /etc/kubernetes/pki/ca.crt: no such file or directory". Rewrite those
fields like Mutate does for Windows nodes.
---
 .../componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_freebsd.go | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../kubelet_paths_freebsd_test.go             | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_other.go   | 25 +++++++++
 .../app/componentconfigs/kubelet_unix.go      |  1 +
 4 files changed, 130 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 cmd/kubeadm/app/componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_freebsd.go
 create mode 100644 cmd/kubeadm/app/componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_freebsd_test.go
 create mode 100644 cmd/kubeadm/app/componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_other.go

diff --git a/cmd/kubeadm/app/componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_freebsd.go b/cmd/kubeadm/app/componentconfigs/kubelet_paths_freebsd.go
